{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國電動車生產商特斯拉（Tesla）上周展示新款「飛天跑車」Roadster Rocket引發話題。</p><p>中國官媒《人民日報》發文稱，不必因特斯拉的新技術展示而妄自菲薄，也不應輕視其他企業的技術探索，呼籲以包容、理性的心態看待。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:00:09.561763+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:34:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T10:37:35.722106+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:57:38.528524+00:00","content_hash":"c283607f5a8f826e3524c2b986141cf54c4de3c20be64288a545d3e53310011f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}